# SPEAKER_ID UEFI variable value -> speaker supplier (supplier names as used in
# firmware/tas2783.lock). One "<value> <supplier>" pair per line.
#
# TODO(hw): unverified by this project. Source: hungarianhc/rog-ally-x20-steamos-speakers
